# Release tree - large local artefacts (exe, zip, feed), never in git
Build/
Version/
Sources/
Encrypt/
Publish/
**/update-test/
fake-update-feed/
customer-update-test/

# Project folders that must never land in git (huge, or local-only).
# A single "git add ." used to be able to push ~290 MB of these.
tools/
accio/
connector/
deploy/
security-audit/
# temp\ holds every loose script/doc. The one file git already tracks is
# re-included so its history is kept; "temp/" alone would block the negation.
temp/*
!temp/publish-github.ps1

# Local backups and probes
_archive/
_backups/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.old
*_recon_*.png
